  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 57bb45da4a607714eaa4a36844303d5d, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeCardDefinition
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarrativeCardDefinition
  narrativeCards:
  - messageContent: At first, it was just a few little things here and there...<br><br>Partially
      consumed cracker rolls, a few misplaced fruit, and a deli container of thinly
      sliced black forest ham that'd inexplicably diminished in weight as the days
      passed by.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 0
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: For quite some time now, I'd noticed that my food had been disappearing.<br><br>On
      most days, I would simply attribute it to any reasonable explanation that came
      to mind.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 2
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: At times, the losses were so severe that there was no rational
      explanation that could account for my dwindling food supplies.<br><br>However,
      as the rumbling in my stomach intensified and my wallet began to feel as light
      as a drifting leaf, I realized I had no option but to dig deeper into the mystery
      before me.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 6
    cardDuration: 7.5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: The way I saw it, there could only be one explanation for the
      missing food.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 9
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: "The way I saw it, there could only be one explanation for the
      missing food.<br><br>My roommate\u2026"
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 9
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: We had met in college and decided to live in an apartment together
      after graduation out of convenience. Though we spent little time together due
      to our schedules, our living situation was remarkably easygoing. So much in
      fact that we went as far as to adopt an adorable pet cat that we cared for
      equally.
    wasShown: 1
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 10
    cardDuration: 25
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: They were the ideal roommate. Considerate, helpful, always timely.
      Flawless in every way. It was ideal given the circumstances.<br><br>And yet,
      as I once again stared into the pale white emptiness that was our communal
      refrigerator; I couldn't escape the nagging feeling that our perfect arrangement
      had begun to unravel.
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 11
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: "My first instinct was to confront them directly, but perhaps
      that kind of approach wasn\u2019t quite my style.<br><br> No, perhaps this
      situation required more finesse."
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 10
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: '"Have you been unfairly wronged?  Are you in need of justice? 
      Do you seek PEACE? OF? MIND?<br><br>For all that and more, look no further
      than the latest and greatest tactical innovations from The Spy jinks Co.<br><br>From
      hidden cameras, audio recorders and everything in between, Spy Jinks has the
      tools YOU need to Uncover the Truth." '
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 11
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: "The timing was perfect\u2026 I knew then that if I had any hope
      of catching the culprit, I'd need a little help."
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: Now that they're out of the house. I should use this time to
      gather up some clues.<br><br>Maybe I can also use this time to take a look
      around at that spy website and <b>make a purchase or two</b>.<br><br>Also,
      if I purchase something in the shop, I should <b>set it up in the apartment<b>.<br><br>Lastly,
      If I find anything of note, I should <br>make sure to file it as an important
      clue in my evidence folder</b>.
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 0
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 600
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: "There\u2019s not much else to do now except wait. I should get
      some rest, only a few hours before my shift."
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 1
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: "These new traps should help out. It\u2019s time for bed."
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 2
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: 
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 2
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: Looks like today is the last day to get any proof. I'll need
      to review what I've got so far and be prepared for tomorrow.
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 2
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 5
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: I should make sure that I've got all of my clues ready before
      I head to bed.
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 3
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 10
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: I could barely sleep.<br><br>I wondered if they'd attempt to
      wash their hands of it all and throw the blame back at me. Even if they tried,
      I'd prepared for just that sort of tactic.<br><br>I had my evidence, it was
      up to them to prove me wrong.
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 4
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 10
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 0
  - messageContent: "\u201CMorning. I've got some coffee on the pot if you'd like
      some\u201D"
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 4
    narrativeOrder: 12
    cardDuration: 10
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 1
  - messageContent: "\u201CMorning. I've got some coffee on the pot if you'd like
