  - messageContent: "\u201CWell, truthfully. There\u2019s something you should know.<br><br>My
      food's been going missing for some time now. A lot of it in fact. Usually when
      I'm asleep or out of the apartment.\u201D"
    wasShown: 0
    narrativePhase: 4
    narrativeOrder: 0
    cardDuration: 10
    narrativeBeatSprite: {fileID: 0}
    prefab: {fileID: 8031229054714573727, guid: 46144ee6793e7274fad2d555075b3d10, type: 3}
    ending: 1
